{"id":"n72622-1-7","stage":3,"title":"일출 · 日出","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72622-1-7-1","ko":"일출 구경은 어땠어?","zh":"看日出的感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일출","meaning":"日出","explanation":"일출：日出","readings":[{"term":"일출","audio":"/audio/ba72247d219577a3a4fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72622","senseId":"1","lemma":"일출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일출","audio":"/audio/ba72247d219577a3a4fe.mp3"}},{"text":"구경은","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64484","senseId":"3","lemma":"구경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구경은","audio":"/audio/bf3b681e49e5b80d0cef.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ba72247d219577a3","term":"일출","zh":"日出","audio":"/audio/ba72247d219577a3a4fe.mp3","entryId":"72622","definition":"太阳升起。","pronunciation":["일출"]},{"id":"f7bcc82cf5b9252f","term":"구경","zh":"赏，观看，游览","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3","entryId":"64484","definition":"用眼睛看或亲自体验。","pronunciation":["구ː경"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a11fe3fdea2262421d9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72622-1-7-2","ko":"빨간 해가 바다에서 솟아오르는데 정말 멋지더라.","zh":"红色的太阳从海面上升起，真的非常壮观。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨간","meaning":"红","explanation":"빨갛다：红；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빨갛다","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71070","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨갛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨간","audio":"/audio/0ae988272a93c5b5b782.mp3"}},{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해가","audio":"/audio/b47f44201b814682f91a.mp3"}},{"text":"바다에서","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다에서","audio":"/audio/5925fd490266913fd59a.mp3"}},{"text":"솟아오르는데","meaning":"升，升起","explanation":"솟아오르다：升，升起；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"솟아오르다","audio":"/audio/08ffc3d78873403d6eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64480","senseId":"1","lemma":"솟아오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솟아오르는데","audio":"/audio/26f0d91158b47cd3e13e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"멋지더라.","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋지더라","audio":"/audio/4e030690d2e96ac79692.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6edc039e433d1613","term":"빨갛다","zh":"红","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3","entryId":"71070","definition":"如同鲜血或熟透的辣椒一样鲜明而浓艳地发红。","pronunciation":["빨ː가타"]},{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","